One frozen formal-right native LIBERO trial, conditional on offline geometry.
There is no planner, alternate action, tuning, object injection or retry here.
The only simulator state initialization is the native constructor and one
native seeded reset. Forward/reset refreshes are counted separately from real
mj_step.

